     1238   PROCEDURE adm-enable :
     1239       ENABLE UNLESS-HIDDEN RECT-12 RECT-3 Classify SelectObject BUTTON-obj Itog show-zero show-qnty Rs-qnty-type SortType TEXT-3-alt Obj-count WITH FRAME F-Main.
     1240       RUN enable_UI IN THIS-PROCEDURE NO-ERROR.
     1241       RUN set-attribute-list ('ENABLED=yes':U).
     1242       RETURN.
     1243   END PROCEDURE.
